  "reason": "The best result so far is config_018, where multiprofile RNA with avgpool, ResNet50 image features, and concat fusion gives the highest accuracy and F1, while image alone is weak and transformer aggregation was less helpful than avgpool. The main untested choice in this promising pipeline is the RNA encoder, since only PCA has been evaluated. config_030 tests whether replacing PCA with a learned scVI RNA representation improves the current best multimodal setting while keeping profile, aggregation, image encoder, and fusion fixed. This is a one-variable extension of the best configuration, balances exploitation of the current best pipeline with exploration of a potentially important representation choice, and may directly yield a better configuration if scVI is more informative than PCA."
